abstract: >-
  Analysis code for an exploratory four-hospital external validation and updating
  study of a random-forest model for obstructive coronary artery disease
  (CAD-RADS 3-5 versus 0-2) in patients already referred for coronary CT
  angiography. Includes model development with repeated cross-validation, frozen
  external validation pooled and by hospital, cross-fitted logistic recalibration,
  a temporal accumulation ladder with a row-matched control arm, and the
  centre-structure and precision analyses. No patient-level data are included.
